<title>HONG KONG: Dao Heng 1995/96 net up 25.16 percent.</title>
<headline>Dao Heng 1995/96 net up 25.16 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   220.0    vs 183.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    55.0     vs 50.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    1,505.81 vs 1,203.11</p>
<p>    Company name		 Dao Heng Bank Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 13-21</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Dao Heng Bank is a unit of Guoco Group Ltd.</p>
<p>The company also proposed a special dividend of HK$0.10 per share.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 88 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 23 cents and special dividend) vs 71 H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
